{"id":"337462c47a6e0696","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-abstract-logic.md","title":"Abstract Logic","display":"df-abstract-logic — Abstract Logic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-abstract-logic","aliases":["57-df-abstract-logic"],"display":"df-abstract-logic — Abstract Logic","depends_on":["[[57-df-formula-algebra]]","[[57-df-endomorphism-algebra]]","[[57-df-closure-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-abstract-logic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-abstract-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-abstract-logic — Abstract Logic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4829220d0330e683\" href=\"?note=4829220d0330e683\" title=\"57-df-formula-algebra\">57-df-formula-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c3641f7a442206b5\" href=\"?note=c3641f7a442206b5\" title=\"57-df-endomorphism-algebra\">57-df-endomorphism-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e8de756444081284\" href=\"?note=e8de756444081284\" title=\"57-df-closure-operator\">57-df-closure-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-abstract-algebraic-logic-—-Abstract-Algebraic-Logic-(Deductive-System)\">df-abstract-algebraic-logic — Abstract Algebraic Logic (Deductive System)</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak F_S=\\langle F,(f_i)_{i\\in I}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak F_S=\\langle F,(f_i)_{i\\in I}\\rangle\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4829220d0330e683\" href=\"?note=4829220d0330e683\" title=\"57-df-formula-algebra\">57-df-formula-algebra</a> 的固定公式代数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{End}(\\mathfrak F_S)\">\\(\\mathrm{End}(\\mathfrak F_S)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c3641f7a442206b5\" href=\"?note=c3641f7a442206b5\" title=\"57-df-endomorphism-algebra\">57-df-endomorphism-algebra</a>。</li>\n<li>固定生成元嵌入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:\\mathrm{Var}\\hookrightarrow F\">\\(j:\\mathrm{Var}\\hookrightarrow F\\)</span>；这里“由变量自由生成”指以下普遍性质：对每个同型代数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B\">\\(\\mathfrak B\\)</span> 及每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\mathrm{Var}\\to|\\mathfrak B|\">\\(h:\\mathrm{Var}\\to|\\mathfrak B|\\)</span>，存在唯一保持全部运算的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar h:F\\to|\\mathfrak B|\">\\(\\bar h:F\\to|\\mathfrak B|\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar h\\circ j=h\">\\(\\bar h\\circ j=h\\)</span>。这不要求标签集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> 字面包含于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cn}:\\mathcal P(F)\\to\\mathcal P(F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cn}:\\mathcal P(F)\\to\\mathcal P(F)\\)</span> 为候选闭包算子，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e8de756444081284\" href=\"?note=e8de756444081284\" title=\"57-df-closure-operator\">57-df-closure-operator</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 为候选演绎系统。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbstractLogic_{AAL}}\">\\(\\mathrm{AbstractLogic_{AAL}}\\)</span> 保留原来的结构性演绎系统类，而不是另一个带模型语义的抽象逻辑对象。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal L\\in\\mathrm{AbstractLogic_{AAL}}\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal L=\\langle\\mathfrak F_S,\\mathrm{Cn}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Cn}:\\mathcal P(F)\\to\\mathcal P(F)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\Gamma,\\Delta\\subseteq F\\;[\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Gamma)\n\\land(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta\\to\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Gamma)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Delta))\n\\land\\mathrm{Cn}(\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Gamma))=\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Gamma)]\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{End}(\\mathfrak F_S)\\;\n\\sigma[\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Gamma)]\\subseteq\\mathrm{Cn}(\\sigma[\\Gamma]).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal L\\in\\mathrm{AbstractLogic_{AAL}}\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal L=\\langle\\mathfrak F_S,\\mathrm{Cn}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Cn}:\\mathcal P(F)\\to\\mathcal P(F)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\Gamma,\\Delta\\subseteq F\\;[\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Gamma)\n\\land(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta\\to\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Gamma)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Delta))\n\\land\\mathrm{Cn}(\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Gamma))=\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Gamma)]\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{End}(\\mathfrak F_S)\\;\n\\sigma[\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Gamma)]\\subseteq\\mathrm{Cn}(\\sigma[\\Gamma]).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限性不是这四条结构闭包条件的逻辑后果。原 Remark 单列的有限性等式不能作为隐藏定义条件，故不将它加入本对象。若后续需要模型、句子或初等子结构，须另声明相应语义表示，不能仅从一个代数及闭包算子中读出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-abstract-algebraic-logic-—-Abstract-Algebraic-Logic-(Deductive-System)","text":"df-abstract-algebraic-logic — Abstract Algebraic Logic (Deductive System)","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-formula-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"4829220d0330e683","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-formula-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-endomorphism-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"c3641f7a442206b5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-endomorphism-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-closure-operator","status":"resolved","id":"e8de756444081284","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-closure-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-formula-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"4829220d0330e683","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak F_S=\\langle F,(f_i)_{i\\in I}\\rangle$ 是 [[57-df-formula-algebra]] 的固定公式代数；$\\mathrm{End}(\\mathfrak F_S)$ 见 [[57-df-endomorphism-algebra]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-endomorphism-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"c3641f7a442206b5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak F_S=\\langle F,(f_i)_{i\\in I}\\rangle$ 是 [[57-df-formula-algebra]] 的固定公式代数；$\\mathrm{End}(\\mathfrak F_S)$ 见 [[57-df-endomorphism-algebra]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-closure-operator","status":"resolved","id":"e8de756444081284","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cn}:\\mathcal P(F)\\to\\mathcal P(F)$ 为候选闭包算子，见 [[57-df-closure-operator]]；$\\mathcal L$ 为候选演绎系统。$\\mathrm{AbstractLogic_{AAL}}$ 保留原来的结构性演绎系统类，而不是另一个带模型语义的抽象逻辑对象。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak F_S=\\langle F,(f_i)_{i\\in I}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{End}(\\mathfrak F_S)","display":false},{"tex":"j:\\mathrm{Var}\\hookrightarrow F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak B","display":false},{"tex":"h:\\mathrm{Var}\\to|\\mathfrak B|","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar h:F\\to|\\mathfrak B|","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar h\\circ j=h","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cn}:\\mathcal P(F)\\to\\mathcal P(F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbstractLogic_{AAL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal L\\in\\mathrm{AbstractLogic_{AAL}}\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathcal L=\\langle\\mathfrak F_S,\\mathrm{Cn}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Cn}:\\mathcal P(F)\\to\\mathcal P(F)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall\\Gamma,\\Delta\\subseteq F\\;[\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Gamma)\n\\land(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta\\to\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Gamma)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Delta))\n\\land\\mathrm{Cn}(\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Gamma))=\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Gamma)]\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{End}(\\mathfrak F_S)\\;\n\\sigma[\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Gamma)]\\subseteq\\mathrm{Cn}(\\sigma[\\Gamma]).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2044,"backlinks":[{"id":"348361ab4be85a8d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal V$ 为所讨论的一阶字母表类，包含所需的子字母表、重命名和有限/可数新常量扩张。一个语义逻辑表示 $\\mathcal L=\\langle\\operatorname{Sen}_{\\mathcal L},V_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle$ 为给定数据：对每个 $S\\in\\mathcal V$，$\\operatorname{Sen}_{\\mathcal L}(S)$ 是句子集合，$V_{\\mathcal L,S}:\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\times\\operatorname{Sen}_{\\mathcal L}(S)\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 是类函数，且同构结构上的同一句取值相同。类量词按背景类理论或固定宇宙解释。该表示不是 [[57-df-abstract-logic]] 的代数—闭包二元组；若从该对象出发，必须额外给定此语义数据，不能凭同名推断。$\\mathcal L(S)$ 为句子集原简写，$\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathcal L(S)$。"},{"id":"0d3445b68d4cfbdb","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"35b5424a3b2d0629","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7ade1cc62edc29c7","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"745fc0c979c72f17","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f9eea9702761a060","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$S$ 为固定的一阶字母表；$\\mathrm{Fml}_S$、$\\mathrm{Struct}_S$ 和 $\\models$ 取 [[57-df-formula]]、[[57-df-structure]]、[[57-df-satisfaction]]。本文件 $\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FO}$ 的旧调用是固定语言的一阶公式类型，以下给出局部别名；它不指 [[57-df-abstract-logic]] 的 AAL 演绎结构，也不把一种逻辑本身当作公式集合。开公式满足仍取所有赋值的全称真值。"},{"id":"309c23fab16da515","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"20192e1f